## Look for

Cadence and volume expectations WITH the account size they came from. How organic gets
measured honestly when there is no cost per asset. Creator agreements, usage rights
windows and disclosure obligations. What transfers from an organic winner into a paid
ad, and what does not.

## Skip

Follower growth advice with no commercial path. Anything treating reach as the
outcome.

